    "description": "6/2013 - present         Software Quality Engineer Lead, \n                                    Lockheed Martin Space Systems \n•\tPrepare SQA plan for the project\n•\tParticipate in the development of the project’s software process description\n•\tReview software engineering activities to verify compliance with the defined software process\n•\tAudit designed software work products to verify compliance with those defined as part of the software process\n•\tEnsure that any deviations in software or work products are documented and handled according to a documented procedure.\n1996 - 1999,  2001 - 2013\n•       Flight software development group of special program that involves a Simics simulation modeling which provides a full systems simulation environment for R750 processor, boards, platforms, racks and complex multimode or multiplatform systems. Also, involved in a real time embedded programming with the vxWorks. Experience in spacecraft Software Development to include, requirements development, software design, software coding and testing, integration, and acceptance testing. \n•\tWorked as an integration and test engineer working on fault testing for the special program.  Development experience with hardware and software interfaces. Worked as an integration and test engineer working on fault testing for the special program.  Development experience with hardware – software interfaces.\n•\tDeveloper on the firmware for special program involving VxWorks operating system.\n•\tInvolved in the VME (MVME5100 MPC7400, MPC750 power pc processor) systems programming in the testbed group.",
